{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Necromancer For A Week",
    "steam_appid": 2987110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/b3d17896777006443bf6972cc2b299c8.webp?t=1755219992\" width=616 height=60 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate Monster taming game for players more interested in battling and trying interesting team line-ups than grinding levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is an opportunity to try new Monsters and combos, and takes approximately 45-60 minutes to complete. Completing a run also unlocks a random Monster as a Starter option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run you'll be presented with a limited number of options as you progress through each night's map, forcing you to make the most out of what you have and find hidden synergies wherever you can.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/fbef73f18eb135b2f17e1ab9ad9fe023.webp?t=1755219992\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins by choosing a Monster (every Monster can be unlocked as a potential Starter). From there you\u2019ll encounter Tombstones with Monsters to reanimate and add to your roster, giving you more options to build your ideal 2-Monster team for battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great care has been taken to ensure that every Monster has it's own unique movepool and playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing a Starter helps alleviate the randomness between runs, ensuring you always have a Monster you enjoy playing with. For those who prefer nuzlocke-style gameplay, a 'Pick Random Monster' option is available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/24ae6d0e1346b55742c4f75ab5afc6ae.webp?t=1755219992\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start each turn with 3 Action Points (AP). Every Move has a cost, and you can use Moves from either Monster on your team \u2013 or both!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together multiple Moves to unleash powerful combos and devastate your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/e8d6dbfac87138d670553a854eddece9.webp?t=1755219992\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night\u2019s main objective is to return to the Necromancer\u2019s Citadel in the middle of the map. Along the way you\u2019ll encounter more Monsters to reanimate, powerful Move Tomes and passives, and unique enemies to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Monsters won't heal until you return to the Citadel at the end of the night, so you'll need to constantly rotate your team and potentially make difficult sacrifices to make it back. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/9d34ed11a370d75bf16b5cbbb830af81.webp?t=1755219992\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Monsters won\u2019t appear in a run until you unlock them by completing certain challenges, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using 9+ Moves in a turn</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dealing at least 99 Damage with a single Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using at least 7 different Monster Team combinations in a single run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win a battle without using any Offensive Moves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/b3d17896777006443bf6972cc2b299c8.webp?t=1755219992\" width=616 height=60 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate Monster taming game for players more interested in battling and trying interesting team line-ups than grinding levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is an opportunity to try new Monsters and combos, and takes approximately 45-60 minutes to complete. Completing a run also unlocks a random Monster as a Starter option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run you'll be presented with a limited number of options as you progress through each night's map, forcing you to make the most out of what you have and find hidden synergies wherever you can.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/fbef73f18eb135b2f17e1ab9ad9fe023.webp?t=1755219992\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins by choosing a Monster (every Monster can be unlocked as a potential Starter). From there you\u2019ll encounter Tombstones with Monsters to reanimate and add to your roster, giving you more options to build your ideal 2-Monster team for battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great care has been taken to ensure that every Monster has it's own unique movepool and playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing a Starter helps alleviate the randomness between runs, ensuring you always have a Monster you enjoy playing with. For those who prefer nuzlocke-style gameplay, a 'Pick Random Monster' option is available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/24ae6d0e1346b55742c4f75ab5afc6ae.webp?t=1755219992\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start each turn with 3 Action Points (AP). Every Move has a cost, and you can use Moves from either Monster on your team \u2013 or both!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together multiple Moves to unleash powerful combos and devastate your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/e8d6dbfac87138d670553a854eddece9.webp?t=1755219992\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night\u2019s main objective is to return to the Necromancer\u2019s Citadel in the middle of the map. Along the way you\u2019ll encounter more Monsters to reanimate, powerful Move Tomes and passives, and unique enemies to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Monsters won't heal until you return to the Citadel at the end of the night, so you'll need to constantly rotate your team and potentially make difficult sacrifices to make it back. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/9d34ed11a370d75bf16b5cbbb830af81.webp?t=1755219992\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Monsters won\u2019t appear in a run until you unlock them by completing certain challenges, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using 9+ Moves in a turn</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dealing at least 99 Damage with a single Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using at least 7 different Monster Team combinations in a single run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win a battle without using any Offensive Moves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more!</p>",
    "short_description": "The ultimate monster-battling roguelike. Over the course of 7 nights you'll reanimate Monsters, teach them powerful Moves and Passives, and assemble the perfect 2-Monster Team to become the ultimate Necromancer! A true Necromancer can win no matter which graves they stumble upon.",
